"ignoreNavChild\":null,\"appendTireFinderParams\":null,\"isParent\":false,\"mode\":\"light\",\"showTransparentNav\":false,\"articleEyebrow\":null,\"articleHeadline\":null,\"articleDescription\":{\"html\":null},\"articleImage\":null,\"isFeaturedArticle\":null,\"articleDate\":null,\"components\":[{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/shop-service\",\"__typename\":\"DynamicComponentModel\",\"jumpNavTitle\":null,\"eyebrow\":null,\"title\":\"Vehicle Repair Services in ${City}, ${State}\",\"dynamicContent\":\"ServicesOffered\",\"contentPath\":null,\"componentWidth\":\"fullBleed\"},{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/tire-shopping\",\"__typename\":\"GridContainerModel\",\"eyebrow\":null,\"headline\":\"Tires Shopping in ${City}, ${State}\",\"description\":{\"html\":null},\"gridComponents\":[{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/shops-content-block-1\",\"__typename\":\"ContentBlockModel\",\"icon\":[\"ggp:icons/aesthetic/aesthetic-handling\"],\"tagStyle\":\"primary\",\"tagSize\":\"large\",\"tag\":\"feature-tag\",\"tagLabel\":null,\"eyebrow\":null,\"headline\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Recommended Tires for Driving in ${City}, ${State}\",\"description\":{\"html\":\"\u003cp\u003eDriving around ${City} requires a tire that can handle its varied weather conditions and unique roads. In ${City}'s varied climate, Goodyear recommends all-season tires. They offer a balanced performance in wet, dry, and even in moderately snowy conditions. But, if you're exploring the countryside in heavier snowfall and with less clear roads, winter tires could provide that extra grip and peace of mind that they will get you out of the cold.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you keep your car in the garage all winter, try our summer tire options to get that ultra high-performance you want from your tires in the heat. Go with Goodyear tires and choose a tire with enhanced tech features and superior grip to tackle all of the adventurous terrain ${State} offers.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"accessibilityLabel\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"startTime\":null,\"endDate\":null,\"endTime\":null,\"buttonLabel\":null,\"buttonUrl\":null,\"buttonAction\":\"sameTab\",\"buttonReferencePath\":null,\"buttonAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForButton\":true,\"linkLabel\":null,\"linkUrl\":null,\"linkAction\":\"sameTab\",\"linkReferencePath\":null,\"linkAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForLink\":true,\"ctaLabel\":null,\"ctaUrl\":null,\"ctaAction\":\"sameTab\",\"ctaReferencePath\":null,\"ctaAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForCTA\":true,\"inlineLabel\":null,\"inlineUrl\":null,\"inlineAction\":\"sameTab\",\"inlineReferencePath\":null,\"inlineAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"onDark\":null,\"iconPosition\":\"top\",\"alignment\":\"left\",\"titleStyle\":\"headline\",\"textSize\":\"large\",\"componentWidth\":\"fullBleed\",\"headingTag\":\"h2\",\"bottomPadding\":\"medium\"},{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/shops-content-block-2\",\"__typename\":\"ContentBlockModel\",\"icon\":[\"ggp:icons/aesthetic/aesthetic-find-tires\"],\"tagStyle\":\"primary\",\"tagSize\":\"large\",\"tag\":\"feature-tag\",\"tagLabel\":null,\"eyebrow\":null,\"headline\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Signs You Need New Tires in ${City}, ${State}\",\"description\":{\"html\":\"\u003cp\u003eKeep an eye out for these telltale signs that it's time for new Goodyear tires:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTread Wear - Uneven or excessively worn treads can compromise your vehicle's grip on ${City}'s roads, especially during sudden downpours or snowy days. Find out how to check your tread wear yourself so you know when it's time for new tires.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVisible Damage - Cracks, cuts, or bulges on the tire's surface are a clear sign that your tires might be ready to replace.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVibration - Excessive vibration while driving, especially when that shaking doesn't make sense for the road conditions, might suggest tire alignment or balance issues. Visit your local Goodyear tire shop for a professional tire inspection.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"accessibilityLabel\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"startTime\":null,\"endDate\":null,\"endTime\":null,\"buttonLabel\":null,\"buttonUrl\":null,\"buttonAction\":\"sameTab\",\"buttonReferencePath\":null,\"buttonAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForButton\":true,\"linkLabel\":null,\"linkUrl\":null,\"linkAction\":\"sameTab\",\"linkReferencePath\":null,\"linkAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForLink\":true,\"ctaLabel\":null,\"ctaUrl\":null,\"ctaAction\":\"sameTab\",\"ctaReferencePath\":null,\"ctaAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForCTA\":true,\"inlineLabel\":null,\"inlineUrl\":null,\"inlineAction\":\"sameTab\",\"inlineReferencePath\":null,\"inlineAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"onDark\":null,\"iconPosition\":\"top\",\"alignment\":\"left\",\"titleStyle\":\"headline\",\"textSize\":\"large\",\"componentWidth\":\"fullBleed\",\"headingTag\":\"h2\",\"bottomPadding\":\"medium\"},{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/shops-content-block-3\",\"__typename\":\"ContentBlockModel\",\"icon\":[\"ggp:icons/aesthetic/aesthetic-driving-tips\"],\"tagStyle\":\"primary\",\"tagSize\":\"large\",\"tag\":\"feature-tag\",\"tagLabel\":null,\"eyebrow\":null,\"headline\":null,\"subtitle\":\"$${City}, ${State} Driving Tips\",\"description\":{\"html\":\"\u003cp\u003eKeep rolling down ${City}'s roads safely with these easy tips:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStay Weather-Wise - Always be aware of sudden weather shifts. A quick glance at the forecast before heading out can make your ride a lot smoother and safer.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMaintain Pressure - With ${State}'s seasonal temperature swings, keeping an eye on your tire pressure isn't just smart-it's key to keeping your ride smooth and your gas bill lower. Learn how to measure your tire's air pressure to avoid a flat tire or any other unforeseen tire issues.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAvoid Potholes – Yep, ${City} has its share of road craters. Drive carefully to dodge those pesky potholes, that will help keep your tires in tip-top shape.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"accessibilityLabel\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"startTime\":null,\"endDate\":null,\"endTime\":null,\"buttonLabel\":null,\"buttonUrl\":null,\"buttonAction\":\"sameTab\",\"buttonReferencePath\":null,\"buttonAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForButton\":true,\"linkLabel\":null,\"linkUrl\":null,\"linkAction\":\"sameTab\",\"linkReferencePath\":null,\"linkAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForLink\":true,\"ctaLabel\":null,\"ctaUrl\":null,\"ctaAction\":\"sameTab\",\"ctaReferencePath\":null,\"ctaAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForCTA\":true,\"inlineLabel\":null,\"inlineUrl\":null,\"inlineAction\":\"sameTab\",\"inlineReferencePath\":null,\"inlineAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"onDark\":null,\"iconPosition\":\"top\",\"alignment\":\"left\",\"titleStyle\":\"headline\",\"textSize\":\"large\",\"componentWidth\":\"fullBleed\",\"headingTag\":\"h2\",\"bottomPadding\":\"medium\"},{\"_path\":\"/content/dam/ggp/goodyear/consumer/na/en-US/pages/shops/components/shops-content-block-4\",\"__typename\":\"ContentBlockModel\",\"icon\":[\"ggp:icons/aesthetic/aesthetic-durability\"],\"tagStyle\":\"primary\",\"tagSize\":\"large\",\"tag\":\"feature-tag\",\"tagLabel\":null,\"eyebrow\":null,\"headline\":null,\"subtitle\":\"$${City}, ${State} Tire Care \u0026 Maintenance\",\"description\":{\"html\":\"\u003cp\u003eProper tire care keeps your vehicle safe and rolling down the road, mile after mile. So, how do you do it right? Caring about your tires means you have to inspect them on a monthly basis for wear and damage, keep them properly inflated, and rotate according to your vehicle manufacturer's recommendations in your owner's manual. In ${City}, where weather and conditions can be a bit unpredictable at times, staying ahead of your tire maintenance can make all the difference in your vehicles' comfort and your tires' lifespan.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eChoose the right tires and keep them in top condition, and you'll ensure a smoother, safer ride for you and your passengers as you explore the sights and everything ${City}, ${State} has to offer. Visit your local Goodyear tire shop for professional tire repair and maintenance services and get the best tires that you can buy for your road ahead.\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"accessibilityLabel\":null,\"startDate\":null,\"startTime\":null,\"endDate\":null,\"endTime\":null,\"buttonLabel\":null,\"buttonUrl\":null,\"buttonAction\":\"sameTab\",\"buttonReferencePath\":null,\"buttonAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForButton\":true,\"linkLabel\":null,\"linkUrl\":null,\"linkAction\":\"sameTab\",\"linkReferencePath\":null,\"linkAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForLink\":true,\"ctaLabel\":null,\"ctaUrl\":null,\"ctaAction\":\"sameTab\",\"ctaReferencePath\":null,\"ctaAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForCTA\":true,\"inlineLabel\":null,\"inlineUrl\":null,\"inlineAction\":\"sameTab\",\"inlineReferencePath\":null,\"inlineAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"onDark\":null,\"iconPosition\":\"top\",\"alignment\":\"left\",\"titleStyle\":\"headline\",\"textSize\":\"large\",\"componentWidth\":\"fullBleed\",\"headingTag\":\"h2\",\"bottomPadding\":\"medium\"}],\"buttonLabel\":null,\"buttonUrl\":null,\"buttonAction\":\"sameTab\",\"buttonReferencePath\":null,\"buttonAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForButton\":true,\"ctaLabel\":null,\"ctaUrl\":null,\"ctaAction\":\"sameTab\",\"ctaReferencePath\":null,\"ctaAccessibilityLabel\":null,\"tireFinderParamsForCTA\":true,\"onDark\":null,\"colorBackground\":\"base\",\"headerDivider\":false,\"contentDivider\":false,\"desktopLayout\":\"2\",\"tabletLayout\":\"responsive\",\"mobileLayout\":\"1\",\"componentWidth\":\"pageWidth\",\"headingStyle\":\"headline\",\"headlineSize\":\"med